_id":"3","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1322067002","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"戴蒙……你不是一直很想要玩具木马吗？妈妈爸爸给你做了一个。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1322067003:0":{"key":"say:4:1322067003:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1322067003","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"不是很精美，但……但我们希望你能喜欢……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1322067004:1":{"key":"say:5:1322067004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1322067004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"戴蒙？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1322067005:1":{"key":"say:6:1322067005:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1322067005","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"或许是因为太伤心，太生气，戴蒙一句话都没有说。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1322067006:1":{"key":"say:7:1322067006:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1322067006","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"戴蒙……别生妈妈的气，好不好？戴蒙？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1322067007:1":{"key":"say:8:1322067007:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1322067007","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"他应该很难受，要不……咱们把奇奇还给他？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1322067008:1":{"key":"say:9:1322067008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1322067008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"但是要是有了奇奇，戴蒙肯定又会忍不住跑出去……不行，奇...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:10:1322067009:1":{"key":"say:10:1322067009:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1322067009","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"唉……吾爱，也别对他太严苛。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1322067010:1":{"key":"say:11:1322067010:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1322067010","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我们想想别的办法……要怎么才能让戴蒙开心一点？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document